{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nobrega8/mbmap-library/main/schema/mbmap-2.schema.json",
  "mbmap": 2,
  "vendor": "Novus",
  "model": "N320 series",
  "models": [
    "N320",
    "N321",
    "N322",
    "N323"
  ],
  "vendor_website": "novus.com.br",
  "description": "Temperature controllers with optional RS485 Modbus RTU: process value, setpoints, hysteresis, output and display status",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-26",
  "source": "Novus N320 line communication protocol 5001292 V2.0",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Line N320 Communication Protocol",
      "version": "5001292 V2.0",
      "url": "https://github.com/user-attachments/files/35246322/doc.2.pdf",
      "note": "table 1 and its notes",
      "accessed": "2026-11-26",
      "sha256": "50fffb18767aec1471e538239e97ee113807eae42180263185085e4917aa0605"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU needs the optional RS485 interface. Functions 03 and 06; broadcast (address 0) writes only. 9600 bit/s, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit; the address is set with Addr.",
    "Registers by model: N320 0 to 7 (0 and 1 both give the process value), N321 0 to 8, N322 0 to 12, N323 0 to 15. A read above the last register of a model returns an exception.",
    "Setpoints, process value and hysteresis are sent multiplied by 10.",
    "A write outside the allowed range stores the nearest limit and returns it.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's document; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "baudrate": 9600,
  "databits": 8,
  "parity": "N",
  "stopbits": 1,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
  "registers": [
    {
      "name": "Setpoint 1",
      "group": "Control",
      "area": "holding",
      "address": 0,
      "type": "int16",
      "scale": 0.1,
      "unit": "°C",
      "access": "RW",
      "description": "Control output setpoint, limited by SPL and SPH. On the N320 it reads the process value"
    },
    {
      "name": "Process value",
      "group": "Measurements",
      "area": "holding",
      "address": 1,
      "type": "int16",
      "scale": 0.1,
      "unit": "°C",
      "access": "R"
    },
    {
      "name": "OUT1 LED",
